                                "sense_id": "0d23b056-0546-39ea-a05c-6fef7dfec59e",
                                "text": "He who corrects a scoffer gets shame for himself, And he who rebukes a wicked man only harms himself",
                                "translation": "El que corrige al escarnecedor, se acarrea afrenta; el que reprende al malvado, atrae mancha sobre sí."
